    "detailed_description": "Simple, but very funny physic puzzle game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a neon world and racers who can use the rope.<br />\r\nChoose your car, paint it however you want, gather crystals and try to cross the finish line!<br />\r\nEarn money for the best vehicle.<br />\r\nPhysics will help you.<br />\r\nAvoid the walls, ride on the ground.<br />\r\nSwing on the rope, jump, fly up and hover!<br />\r\nAlso, you can open game modes: gravity, boost and teleportation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSpecial features:<br />\r\n- Ropes<br />\r\n- Vehicles<br />\r\n- Retrowave music<br />\r\n- Meditative gameplay",
